Biar kubantu menaruh kopermu.

540
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:14,880 
Sang Zhi!

541
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:16,520 
Jiang Ming.

542
00:37:17,520 --> 00:37:19,000 
